   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tv&#xe5; fortbildningskurser riktade till kvinnor avseende management och marknadsf&#xf6;ring samt seminarieserie vid ICWM (Murmansk State Technical University). Syftet &#xe4;r att ge de kvinnliga deltagarna kunskap som &#xe4;r relevant i deras yrkesverksamhet. Projektet fortg&#xe5;r under ett &#xe5;rs tid.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Two training courses for women related to advertisement and office management and a series of seminars related to women issues at the &quot;Women Management Institute&quot; at the Murmansk State Technical University. The aim is to give the participants knowledge useful in their professional career. The duration of the project is one year.</narrative>
